{"title":"2016 AMC 8 Problems/Problem 10","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_2\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-7\"><a href=\"#Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">7</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-8\"><a href=\"#See_Also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">8</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See Also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Suppose that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/5/2b55f7c96c9ed8b34359301f6045d0034e733cc5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a * b$\" width=\"35\" height=\"12\" /> means <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/2/af2333a4c68f08d7646c9703cf27b4582ab23735.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a-b.$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"56\" height=\"16\" /> What is the value of <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> if\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/2/f/c2f6515e388e34fda66b684dcf2dc3b67ef1bc83.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[2 * (5 * x)=1\\]\" width=\"109\" height=\"18\" />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/f/6/af68d8b74b29019e5961bfdce454b3ca191843e4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\textbf{(A) }\\frac{1}{10} \\qquad\\textbf{(B) }2\\qquad\\textbf{(C) }\\frac{10}{3} \\qquad\\textbf{(D) }10\\qquad \\textbf{(E) }14$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"400\" height=\"38\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us plug in <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/a/a/2aaf5a70c9095fca026ee56708bc059987c2b81c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(5 * x)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"83\" height=\"18\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee79a085a4db08ab71eacb431807959ff6eb3240.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a-b$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />. Thus it would be <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/9/fe9b8ccdb1556a799a2154adc8533d2654ef5a5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(5)-x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"18\" />. Now we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/b/26b828a55094b4aa0e8c0cd257d4cf58b0a97104.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2*(15-x)=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"123\" height=\"18\" />. Plugging <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/4/d/a4d188a9b9edac6a9898db1db7b989a88619c9ed.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2*(15-x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"93\" height=\"20\" /> into <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/e/7/ee79a085a4db08ab71eacb431807959ff6eb3240.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a-b$\" width=\"49\" height=\"12\" />, we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/e/0/5e07e66031f16fb78a277c6ad7eb8566bf9b63a2.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$6-15+x=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"114\" height=\"14\" />. Solving for <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/6/e/26eeb5258ca5099acf8fe96b2a1049c48c89a5e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"10\" /> we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/6/1/c61c1f668c35a5c27c69301b25294456176e3130.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[-9+x=1\\]\" width=\"86\" height=\"14\" /><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/e/79ee27e8c64bd1f7b4906b292dcb3704d68e7c15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}   \\,        10}\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2\">Solution 2</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Let us set a variable <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/9/2/092e364e1d9d19ad5fffb0b46ef4cc7f2da02c1c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"11\" height=\"13\" /> equal to <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/636cb44cfd552803a861fc0c1b1b8d037b649209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 * x$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" />. Solving for y in the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/e/dfecee256f3c9626e4510806e55e7bcce651c45d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3(2)-y=1$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"96\" height=\"18\" />, we see that y is equal to five. By substitution, we see that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/636cb44cfd552803a861fc0c1b1b8d037b649209.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5 * x$\" width=\"36\" height=\"12\" /> = 5. Solving for x in the equation <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/5/a05cacc122a066cb9f9907893be036360d6c42b5.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$5(3)-x = 5$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"100\" height=\"20\" /> we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/9/e/79ee27e8c64bd1f7b4906b292dcb3704d68e7c15.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[x=\\boxed{\\textbf{(D)}   \\,        10}\\]\" width=\"96\" height=\"28\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/cR1GDMq1Cv4?si=KktuZcPdJxqC83rg\">https://youtu.be/cR1GDMq1Cv4?si=KktuZcPdJxqC83rg</a>\n</p><p>A solution so simple that a 12-year-old made it!\n</p><p>~Elijahman~\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Video_Solution_.28CREATIVE_THINKING.21.21.21.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_(CREATIVE_THINKING!!!)\">Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution (CREATIVE THINKING!!!)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/0FhGMy0mCVU\">https://youtu.be/0FhGMy0mCVU</a>\n</p><p>~Education, the Study of Everything\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_2\">Video Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/ysYNhG_uG-I\">https://youtu.be/ysYNhG_uG-I</a>\n</p><p>~savannahsolver\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Video_Solution_by_OmegaLearn\">Video Solution by OmegaLearn</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=7\" title=\"Edit section: Video Solution by OmegaLearn\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external free\" href=\"https://youtu.be/TkZvMa30Juo?t=638\">https://youtu.be/TkZvMa30Juo?t=638</a>\n</p><p>~pi_is_3.14\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_Also\">See Also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2016_AMC_8_Problems/Problem_10&amp;action=edit&amp;section=8\" title=\"Edit section: See Also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=